<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#222222" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">I hope all is well. It's been about a year since you last spoke with someone from our company and I wanted to touch base with you to see if you would like to&nbsp;</span><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/64xbg/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5be04-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000002-a2127jlrs5h31n1ejli4aevt0msiag6p&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/64xbg/schedule/availability?wfsid%3D16a5be04-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000002-a2127jlrs5h31n1ejli4aevt0msiag6p%26view%3Dfull%26fs%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1562790716755000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHWg7eQaywNdl8Cz_DRFe6CvpCPBw" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">jump on a call with me</a><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;to discuss your investment goals. The purpose of the call would be to determine if you are still interested in building an investment portfolio&nbsp;with a turnkey real estate investment company.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><u style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Here are few bullet points about Memphis Invest:</u><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">- Family Owned turnkey company with 16&nbsp;years of experience assisting out-of-area real estate investors to build their passive income portfolios.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">-We own our own property management company, where we manage almost 5300 properties exclusively for the 2200+ investor clients that have purchased properties from Memphis Invest.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">-We offer cash flowing, fully rehabbed properties in Memphis, Dallas, Houston,&nbsp;Little Rock, Oklahoma City, Tulsa and St. Louis.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">-We do not publish our properties on our website. You will need to speak with a portfolio adviser, who will help you determine whether we are a good fit to work together as a company and a potential investor/client.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">-Our average properties are priced between $140-220k depending on market.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">-Our average tenant resident stays almost 5 years. Our average maintenance per property is less than 4% of gross rents annually, and our average vacancy per property is less than 3% annually.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">-Over 1/3 of our clients have 4 properties or more with us, and over 50% of new clients come in as referrals from existing clients.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">-We have every piece of infrastructure in place that an investor could ever need in order to invest, including our network of approved lenders (Fannie Mae conventional financing, non-conventional financing, and non-recourse financing for retirement accounts such as solo-401ks and self-directed IRAs), a discounted group policy property insurance, closing attorneys, title companies, 1031 exchange companies, and IRA custodian companies that can help position your retirement accounts so that you can invest in real estate.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If you have not already checked out our site, please visit&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.memphisinvest.com/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.memphisinvest.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1562790716755000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGEVn1HbIr1kd7ZSk-3nXQ5pDx2xw" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">MemphisInvest&nbsp;</a><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;when you get a chance today and you can learn more about us. Particularly, I encourage you to watch the client videos. Our clients will all tell you some version of the same message- that we are not perfect, but we take great care of them.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">So now that you know a little more about us, let's schedule a call if you feel like this is possibly the right path for you.&nbsp;</span><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/64xbg/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5be04-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000002-a2127jlrs5h31n1ejli4aevt0msiag6p&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/64xbg/schedule/availability?wfsid%3D16a5be04-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000002-a2127jlrs5h31n1ejli4aevt0msiag6p%26view%3Dfull%26fs%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1562790716755000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHWg7eQaywNdl8Cz_DRFe6CvpCPBw" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">You can use this link here</a><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;to schedule a call with me this week at a time that works well for you.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Looking forward to connecting with you soon.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Sincerely,</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Ben</span><br clear="all" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div dir="ltr" class="m_3396878806554249465gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/64XBG" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://my.timetrade.com/book/64XBG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1562790716755000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGXscsYh2qE4R9ojANOvean45Ernw" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><img src="https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Fi-LvmCPc1FD5qVWvWfrNoRO4OAiBv25_uWmcO7xwevrKELZPSjGC1sZXXSf6mwwiMNek6vo6IfH8RgtyVdvlbKj_735C655NWf7rozMbQLUtg0lA290uVTUhAwwAseeaN9Upynq3iZTsz0o9MDXSF4ClHAlw1n-B4lYRBII15WHSrFQ2X-OG_b4Md1E0oW9i8dBNOytwB6FYOeqeg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1dmYHwbBZppSiVLTErHMsgORMSrHoT9sU&amp;revid=0B09QfomT_h2yclNneTZHT2ZMQUdzU09qZ2VvTCt1K1F0Unc0PQ" width="420" height="256" class="CToWUd"></a></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
